    "detailed_description": "Step into the world of &quot;How to Train Your Car&quot;, where racing meets strategy, mentorship, and evolution. In this innovative simulation, your goal isn't just to be the fastest; it's to mold, nurture, and fine-tune your car's performance. Every training session counts, every decision affects your car's growth, and every race tests the bond you've formed. Will you emerge as the top trainer, guiding your car to championship glory?",
