        "notes": "Agame is a game centered around combat scenarios where two teams, terrorists and counter-terrorists, engage in shooting battles. The game involves the use of various firearms, explosives, and tactical equipment. While there is violence in the form of shooting and explosions, the game does not depict gore, dismemberment, or explicit brutality. It's important to note that the game has a mature rating due to the violent nature of the gameplay.\r\n\r\nAgame's primary focus is on competitive gameplay and multiplayer action, and it doesn't heavily feature storylines or narrative elements. Therefore, topics such as drug and alcohol abuse or self-harm are generally not present within the game's content."
